  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">bistro salad arrives like a midsummer fête on your plate, bright and full of sunny flavors. Crisp romaine and peppery arugula mingle with juicy heirloom tomatoes, creamy avocado, and thin ribbons of cucumber. Tangy goat cheese crumbles and honey-kissed toasted walnuts add luxurious texture, while a golden citrus Dijon vinaigrette made with orange juice, apple cider vinegar, olive oil, and a whisper of grainy mustard ties it all together. Every forkful of bistro salad is a lively melody of crunch and cream, perfect for an effortless lunch or a side that sparks pure joy.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-bistro-salad\">Why You’ll Love This bistro salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-bistro-salad\">How to Make Bistro Salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-bistro-salad\">Pro Tips for Making bistro salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-bistro-salad\">How to Serve this bistro salad</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-bistro-salad\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This bistro salad</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Fresh, vibrant ingredients that awaken your taste buds.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly balanced flavors for a delightful crunch.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare, making it a weeknight favorite.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile enough to pair with any protein or enjoy solo.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthy and satisfying, leaving you feeling great!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7224\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7224\" data